WEBVTT

01:30.310 --> 01:34.900
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.140 --> 01:37.710
[Episode 14]

01:46.070 --> 01:48.170
These clothes are so trashy.

01:48.280 --> 01:50.120
I got hangnails.

01:56.030 --> 01:57.640
What's all this stuff?

01:57.640 --> 01:58.509
It's filthy.

02:01.200 --> 02:02.790
The food is so awful.

02:03.350 --> 02:05.350
Even my servants wouldn't eat this.

02:05.350 --> 02:06.410
Exactly.

02:06.510 --> 02:08.430
Wasn't our life in the celestial mountain
supposed to be enjoyable?

02:08.430 --> 02:09.840
We became laborers instead.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.640
We were promised eternal youth.

02:11.710 --> 02:14.120
But my skin is visibly getting worse.

02:15.840 --> 02:17.040
Are you still eating?

02:17.590 --> 02:18.920
If not, I'll take it all.

02:19.120 --> 02:19.840
Go ahead.

02:26.310 --> 02:27.220
What do you think

02:27.220 --> 02:28.960
the next trial is about?

02:29.079 --> 02:31.079
The first one was already so difficult.

02:31.079 --> 02:33.120
I heard it's about needlework.

02:33.360 --> 02:34.710
It's to see whose clothes

02:34.710 --> 02:36.190
can satisfy Dreamshard Immortal.

02:36.190 --> 02:37.960
I heard it's a test of skills.

02:38.280 --> 02:40.840
We have to master
etiquette, music, riding, and archery.

02:40.840 --> 02:41.550
Oh, no.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.590
I'm not proficient in any of these arts.

02:43.590 --> 02:45.079
It doesn't matter
if you're not proficient in them.

02:45.079 --> 02:46.410
Didn't the immortal say

02:46.710 --> 02:48.630
that anyone who passed the first trial

02:48.630 --> 02:50.590
could already stay in
the Realm of Mist and Void

02:50.590 --> 02:51.390
and do chores?

02:51.840 --> 02:52.400
What?

02:52.590 --> 02:53.280
What?

02:53.280 --> 02:54.800
I've come a long way to be here.

02:54.800 --> 02:55.870
Instead of enjoying life at home,

02:55.870 --> 02:57.470
I came here just to do chores?

02:57.590 --> 02:58.280
Exactly.

02:58.630 --> 02:59.900
How can I do chores?

03:00.030 --> 03:01.560
It's dirty and exhausting.

03:02.080 --> 03:02.430
I...

03:08.240 --> 03:10.470
Whatever the second trial involves,

03:11.240 --> 03:13.750
it demands both physical strength
and mental effort.

03:13.750 --> 03:15.210
Make sure you're well-fed

03:15.240 --> 03:16.280
and well-rested.

03:17.150 --> 03:19.480
That's better than useless speculation.

03:21.870 --> 03:22.310
Look.

03:28.710 --> 03:30.240
It looks worse.

03:41.730 --> 03:42.530
What's wrong?

03:45.190 --> 03:47.680
The scar on Pianpian's face
is much more inflamed.

03:47.680 --> 03:49.280
This is your doing, isn't it?

03:49.430 --> 03:50.630
Don't talk nonsense.

03:51.150 --> 03:54.079
That was the immortal dew
bestowed by Immortal Lord.

03:54.240 --> 03:56.280
Even though it was bestowed
by Immortal Lord,

03:56.280 --> 03:58.280
you must have added something to it.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.720
Tell me. What did you add?

04:04.240 --> 04:05.930
Don't tell anyone else.

04:06.580 --> 04:07.280
Say it.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.470
I just

04:08.470 --> 04:10.460
added some oleander sap

04:10.560 --> 04:12.240
and datura nectar.

04:13.680 --> 04:14.890
The worst of her suffering

04:14.890 --> 04:16.360
is yet to come.

04:17.649 --> 04:19.000
Even if she's in agony,

04:19.510 --> 04:21.570
she wouldn't dare ask Immortal Lord.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.930
She could only express gratitude.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.570
What's wrong with you?

05:03.390 --> 05:04.630
What happened to your face?

05:04.630 --> 05:06.290
It looks like it was poisoned.

05:07.680 --> 05:08.360
I'm fine.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.190
If this wound isn't cleaned promptly,

05:12.190 --> 05:13.790
the scar will become deeper.

05:15.160 --> 05:17.560
What does it matter
if it's deep or shallow?

05:18.000 --> 05:19.720
It's just an outer covering.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.690
A woman should cherish her appearance.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.500
Have you made up your mind?

06:04.940 --> 06:06.140
Serve Immortal Lord.

06:13.190 --> 06:15.920
Bearing the vengeance
for my family and country,

06:16.720 --> 06:18.580
I slew demons for the human realm.

06:20.510 --> 06:22.680
But now, I'm being asked

06:24.870 --> 06:26.430
to help demons hurt humans.

06:29.600 --> 06:32.150
How could I possibly agree?

06:34.780 --> 06:36.980
There's no real difference, actually.

06:37.159 --> 06:39.090
In the human realm, you slay demons

06:40.430 --> 06:42.480
to earn the Emperor's favor

06:43.600 --> 06:45.060
for promotion and titles.

06:46.040 --> 06:47.600
Even with bad luck,

06:48.310 --> 06:50.840
you could still rely on
the Feiyu Guard's name

06:51.560 --> 06:53.680
to make life easier.

06:56.070 --> 06:57.670
In the Realm of Mist and Void,

06:59.750 --> 07:01.750
as long as you please Immortal Lord,

07:04.720 --> 07:06.600
you can also earn favor.

07:07.050 --> 07:08.070
If not,

07:08.510 --> 07:10.680
you can just obey orders and survive.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.920
As long as you avoid disobedience,

07:12.920 --> 07:13.750
mistakes,

07:14.600 --> 07:15.530
and affections,

07:19.130 --> 07:21.330
you can still keep your miserable life.

07:22.750 --> 07:24.010
Different positions,

07:24.080 --> 07:25.580
but the same point.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.310
But I slay demons

07:33.180 --> 07:35.190
for righteousness

07:35.720 --> 07:36.720
and the people.

07:39.720 --> 07:42.180
All these years
in the Realm of Mist and Void,

07:43.040 --> 07:44.170
the people I've seen

07:46.800 --> 07:49.680
have been enough
to make me lose faith in human nature.

07:49.680 --> 07:51.310
In the human realm, you must have faced

07:51.310 --> 07:52.750
far more than I have.

07:54.870 --> 07:56.510
How can you still be so naive?

07:57.000 --> 07:57.870
Human nature

07:59.240 --> 08:01.270
has its greed and depravity,

08:03.510 --> 08:05.920
but there's also ultimate sacrifice.

08:08.070 --> 08:10.130
I've seen both the utmost wickedness

08:11.160 --> 08:12.680
and the purest kindness.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.240
It seems

08:16.070 --> 08:19.600
that you've been confined too long
in the Realm of Mist and Void.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.650
If one day

08:22.120 --> 08:23.250
you have the chance,

08:25.950 --> 08:27.680
you should go out

08:29.950 --> 08:32.200
and see the vast world.

08:33.630 --> 08:35.289
You can't even save yourself,

08:37.390 --> 08:38.990
yet you still worry about me?

08:39.720 --> 08:41.510
This is Lu's wish.

08:44.270 --> 08:47.130
From the moment I entered
the Realm of Mist and Void,

08:49.080 --> 08:51.630
I never expected to leave alive.

08:55.510 --> 08:57.640
I've told you all I needed to say to you.

09:00.110 --> 09:02.110
I'll try my best to buy you more time.

09:03.680 --> 09:05.740
But if Immortal Lord loses patience,

09:06.000 --> 09:06.960
you and Tan'er

09:07.530 --> 09:09.340
will have no chance of regret.

09:14.270 --> 09:15.960
The wound on your face

09:17.090 --> 09:19.910
looks more inflamed than it did last time.

09:22.500 --> 09:23.800
Were you poisoned?

09:25.290 --> 09:26.680
Take some petals

09:27.150 --> 09:28.680
of roses and trumpet vines,

09:29.480 --> 09:31.680
crush them, and apply them to the wound.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.440
It'll reduce swelling and remove toxins.

09:34.440 --> 09:35.680
I've seen

09:36.360 --> 09:38.360
both types of flowers on the island.

09:43.400 --> 09:44.150
Thank you.

10:03.650 --> 10:05.380
I was just about to look for you.

10:09.320 --> 10:10.180
This is for you.

10:10.520 --> 10:10.980
This...

10:11.360 --> 10:12.090
What's this?

10:12.270 --> 10:13.720
It's ointment made from

10:13.720 --> 10:14.670
5 types of flower petals.

10:14.670 --> 10:15.440
It promotes blood circulation,
removes blood stasis

10:15.440 --> 10:16.750
clears heat, and removes toxins.

10:16.750 --> 10:17.950
Apply it to your face,

10:18.000 --> 10:19.800
and your wound will heal faster.

10:26.550 --> 10:27.720
Why are you

10:28.390 --> 10:29.480
being so nice to me?

10:32.150 --> 10:33.940
Although you're from
the Realm of Mist and Void,

10:33.940 --> 10:35.100
I can see

10:35.360 --> 10:37.160
that you still have a kind heart.

10:38.080 --> 10:40.210
Besides, I picked these flowers here.

10:40.250 --> 10:41.450
It's no bother at all.

10:43.670 --> 10:45.930
No wonder Hong Ye cares for you so deeply.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.990
You truly deserve it.

10:51.150 --> 10:52.350
Hurry up and apply it.

11:04.510 --> 11:05.640
These dishes again.

11:05.930 --> 11:06.860
I'm so sick of it.

11:08.840 --> 11:11.670
When is the second trial going to begin?

11:13.150 --> 11:13.960
Yes.

11:13.990 --> 11:15.510
It's like a knife hanging above our necks,

11:15.510 --> 11:16.480
never falling,

11:16.670 --> 11:19.070
yet terrifying enough
to scare us to death.

11:20.080 --> 11:20.870
Dali.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.750
In the second trial,

11:22.750 --> 11:23.790
can I follow you?

11:23.790 --> 11:25.590
I think you'll definitely pass.

11:29.150 --> 11:31.280
Why do you think I'll definitely pass?

11:32.390 --> 11:34.440
If only one of us

11:34.440 --> 11:35.840
can pass,

11:36.030 --> 11:37.270
it must be you.

11:39.840 --> 11:41.510
Can I follow you?

11:42.690 --> 11:43.320
Sure.

12:05.510 --> 12:06.040
Xiao Yao.

12:10.550 --> 12:11.840
If only one person

12:11.840 --> 12:13.300
can pass the second trial,

12:14.320 --> 12:15.240
that must be me.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.390
Good luck.

13:02.360 --> 13:04.620
Immortal Lord, I pray for your blessing.

13:04.870 --> 13:07.120
If I can successfully pass the trial,

13:07.480 --> 13:09.280
I'll devote myself completely,

13:10.000 --> 13:12.200
being your most outstanding disciple.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.000
Little Leaf.

13:24.870 --> 13:26.000
In the second trial,

13:27.870 --> 13:29.670
you must protect Xiao Yao.

13:46.030 --> 13:48.560
Among thousands of flowers
in the flower sea,

13:49.360 --> 13:51.160
why are you the most special one?

13:52.240 --> 13:54.120
How do you have so much water?

14:01.910 --> 14:03.080
When you were a human being,

14:03.080 --> 14:04.680
you must have been a crybaby.

14:07.600 --> 14:08.150
Xiao Yao.

14:16.750 --> 14:18.240
The wound on your face looks much better.

14:18.240 --> 14:18.630
Yes.

14:18.770 --> 14:20.370
Thank you for your ointment.

14:21.480 --> 14:23.110
I came to tell you

14:23.390 --> 14:25.510
that the second trial
begins tomorrow at 9 p.m.

14:25.510 --> 14:28.110
in the east courtyard
of the Biexin Courtyard.

14:28.320 --> 14:29.340
The second trial

14:29.390 --> 14:30.670
is full of mechanisms.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.510
No one has ever passed it before.

14:32.510 --> 14:35.270
Consider carefully
whether you want to participate.

14:35.270 --> 14:35.870
Thank you.

15:45.790 --> 15:46.920
What's that sound?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.440
It's so creepy.

15:51.080 --> 15:53.100
This place is called
the Courtyard of Summoned Mysteries.

15:53.100 --> 15:55.030
It's normally closed to everyone.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.270
Previously,

15:56.550 --> 15:57.720
a woman

15:57.790 --> 15:59.240
was betrayed by her companion

15:59.240 --> 16:00.770
and died in this courtyard.

16:01.270 --> 16:02.870
Because her resentment was so deep,

16:02.870 --> 16:04.790
her vengeful spirit never dispersed.

16:04.790 --> 16:05.630
This place

16:05.630 --> 16:08.200
is like a stubborn miasma
of the Realm of Mist and Void.

16:08.200 --> 16:09.240
Your trial

16:09.470 --> 16:12.800
is to find a way to dispel
the vengeful spirit's resentment.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.910
Once the trial begins,

16:17.510 --> 16:19.630
the gate of the Courtyard of Mysteries
will only open again

16:19.630 --> 16:21.790
when the vengeful spirit disperses.

16:26.170 --> 16:27.550
If the resentment isn't dispelled,

16:27.550 --> 16:29.610
will the door remain closed forever?

16:30.270 --> 16:31.270
Not necessarily.

16:32.980 --> 16:34.370
If you all die,

16:34.790 --> 16:36.250
the gate will open as well.

16:37.600 --> 16:40.480
-What should we do? Let's go home.
-It's okay. This wall isn't high.

16:40.480 --> 16:41.080
At worst,

16:41.080 --> 16:42.210
we can climb over it.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.810
You can try.

16:47.080 --> 16:48.630
You should think carefully.

16:48.630 --> 16:50.390
If you give up now,

16:50.840 --> 16:53.300
you can still be a kitchen maid
on the island.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.380
However,

16:54.910 --> 16:58.310
you won't have the honor
of serving Immortal Lord at her side.

17:00.300 --> 17:00.790
This…

17:00.840 --> 17:01.270
This…

17:08.790 --> 17:09.990
If someone is late,

17:10.480 --> 17:11.960
does it count as giving up?

17:14.109 --> 17:16.560
I'll give you 30 minutes to consider.

17:16.720 --> 17:18.240
Once the trial begins,

17:18.349 --> 17:19.400
no one

17:19.550 --> 17:22.750
will be able to enter or leave
the Courtyard of Mysteries.

17:22.920 --> 17:24.200
She's stalling for time,

17:24.200 --> 17:26.000
clearly waiting for Xiao Yao.

17:26.829 --> 17:27.550
Dali.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.680
I'd never left my chamber before.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.960
I'm as weak as a kitten.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.600
Can I follow you this time?

17:33.270 --> 17:34.100
Dali.

17:34.240 --> 17:36.720
This bracelet was bestowed on me
by the Empress.

17:36.720 --> 17:38.320
It's the only one of its kind.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.750
I'd like to give it to you

17:39.750 --> 17:42.810
as a token of our sworn sisterhood.
Would you accept it?

17:43.750 --> 17:45.610
If it doesn't fit, then forget it.

17:46.790 --> 17:47.520
It fits well.

17:47.790 --> 17:49.000
This bracelet suits you well.

17:49.000 --> 17:49.510
Dali.

17:49.510 --> 17:50.440
Dali.

17:50.440 --> 17:52.030
Dali, you're so clever.

17:52.030 --> 17:53.000
You'll definitely find a way.

17:53.000 --> 17:53.720
Dali.

17:54.270 --> 17:55.840
Exactly.

17:56.750 --> 17:57.200
Then

17:57.480 --> 17:58.550
you'll have to listen to me later.

17:58.550 --> 17:58.880
Okay.

17:58.920 --> 17:59.720
-Okay.
-Okay.

18:07.240 --> 18:08.400
I'm not late, am I?

18:10.000 --> 18:12.790
I thought you didn't want
to participate in the trial.

18:12.790 --> 18:13.790
How could that be?

18:16.330 --> 18:18.490
I believe in myself, my friends,

18:18.630 --> 18:20.020
but not in fate.

18:21.240 --> 18:23.170
Someone claimed that I would lose.

18:23.400 --> 18:25.830
So I'm determined to prove her wrong.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.340
It's time.

18:39.640 --> 18:41.370
All of you are in the courtyard,

18:41.440 --> 18:44.240
so you've all decided
to participate in the trial?

18:45.160 --> 18:45.960
Very good.

18:46.880 --> 18:50.070
Each of you has already
distinguished yourself among a hundred.

18:50.070 --> 18:51.440
However, in this trial,

18:51.870 --> 18:53.830
rewards will be given based on merit.

18:53.830 --> 18:55.630
Only one with the greatest merit

18:55.790 --> 18:57.650
will earn Immortal Lord's favor.

19:04.270 --> 19:05.750
The trial begins now.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.340
Before this candle burns out,

19:08.440 --> 19:10.750
if you still can't
put the vengeful spirit to rest,

19:10.750 --> 19:13.070
you'll remain here with her forever.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.400
This...

19:16.550 --> 19:17.030
This...

19:17.200 --> 19:18.400
Take care, everyone.

19:46.750 --> 19:47.440
The candle!

19:48.600 --> 19:50.730
Hurry up. Come and protect the candle.

19:52.070 --> 19:53.200
You cover this side.

19:53.440 --> 19:55.900
Just guarding it like this
isn't a solution.

19:56.110 --> 19:57.310
What do you want to do?

20:00.830 --> 20:01.890
What are you doing?

20:02.700 --> 20:03.960
Put it back.

20:03.960 --> 20:05.750
If the candle goes out,
the task will also be count a failure.

20:05.750 --> 20:06.270
Exactly.

20:06.270 --> 20:06.790
Exactly.

20:06.790 --> 20:08.850
You... Why are you taking the candle?

20:09.400 --> 20:10.680
Put the candle down.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.200
Or you'll get us all killed.

20:12.200 --> 20:12.800
Come back!

20:13.680 --> 20:14.560
Xiao Yao!

20:14.790 --> 20:15.640
Come back!

20:15.750 --> 20:16.880
Come back quickly!

20:17.200 --> 20:17.790
Xiao Yao!

20:17.790 --> 20:18.580
Hurry back!

20:18.640 --> 20:19.860
Come back now!

20:19.910 --> 20:21.000
The candle must not go out.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.330
What is she trying to do?

20:22.350 --> 20:23.200
What's she doing?

20:23.200 --> 20:23.750
Xiao Yao!

20:23.790 --> 20:24.350
Xiao Yao!

20:24.400 --> 20:24.920
Xiao Yao!

20:24.920 --> 20:26.520
There's clearly a door here.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.540
What should we do, Dali?

20:28.720 --> 20:30.520
Let's see what she's going to do.

20:36.790 --> 20:37.920
What is she trying to do?

20:37.920 --> 20:38.570
Right.

20:45.320 --> 20:46.750
Xiao Yao, be careful!

20:48.960 --> 20:50.220
It's so scary.

20:56.290 --> 20:58.020
There's a door here. Come over.

20:58.070 --> 20:59.000
There's a door. Look!

20:59.000 --> 20:59.800
That's great!

21:02.030 --> 21:02.670
Slow down.

21:06.830 --> 21:07.560
Take it slow.

21:08.350 --> 21:10.080
-Be careful.
-Watch your step.

21:19.400 --> 21:20.110
Dali!

21:20.160 --> 21:21.900
Dali. I'm scared.

21:24.200 --> 21:25.590
Let's all hold hands.

21:25.660 --> 21:26.860
Don't get separated.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.240
Dali.

21:29.440 --> 21:30.250
Dali.

21:30.400 --> 21:31.000
What's wrong?

21:31.000 --> 21:31.880
What's wrong, Dali?

21:31.880 --> 21:32.540
Dali.

21:33.610 --> 21:34.480
Dali.

21:38.270 --> 21:39.270
All of you come in.

21:41.240 --> 21:41.940
Let's go.

21:41.970 --> 21:43.170
Have them hold hands.

21:44.880 --> 21:45.920
Hold hands.

21:47.480 --> 21:48.480
Give me your hand.

21:50.720 --> 21:51.110
Be careful.

21:51.110 --> 21:51.710
Slow down.

21:52.030 --> 21:52.660
Easy.

21:54.000 --> 21:55.330
Watch out for the steps.

21:56.160 --> 21:57.090
There are steps.

21:57.830 --> 21:58.440
Careful.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.430
Stay closer.

22:02.680 --> 22:04.680
Seems like the trap was set too easy.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.500
It doesn't matter.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.490
This is just the beginning.

22:30.200 --> 22:30.880
Move.

22:31.000 --> 22:32.030
Why aren't you moving?

22:32.030 --> 22:33.030
I want to move.

22:33.160 --> 22:35.120
But I can't!

22:37.480 --> 22:39.080
Why are your hands so sweaty?

22:39.110 --> 22:40.110
It's disgusting.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.790
I'm sorry.

22:42.030 --> 22:42.880
Hurry up.

22:43.640 --> 22:44.510
Move quickly!

22:44.590 --> 22:45.660
Come on!

22:45.720 --> 22:46.590
Hurry!

22:46.640 --> 22:47.490
Quick!

22:47.750 --> 22:49.410
If you want to get out, shut up.

22:51.310 --> 22:52.590
Girl, don't panic.

22:52.790 --> 22:54.310
First, lean against the wall.

22:54.310 --> 22:55.400
Take a deep breath.

22:56.200 --> 22:57.930
Turn sideways and come slowly.

22:58.550 --> 22:59.000
Go.

23:02.350 --> 23:02.990
Come on.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.000
Careful.

23:06.000 --> 23:06.640
Slowly.

23:24.710 --> 23:25.400
Watch out!

23:34.160 --> 23:34.930
Be careful.

24:04.070 --> 24:04.550
They're lit.

24:04.550 --> 24:05.350
It's working!

24:05.440 --> 24:05.960
They lit up!

24:05.960 --> 24:06.690
It's bright!

24:09.080 --> 24:09.930
It's bright!

24:12.110 --> 24:12.760
Great!

24:12.920 --> 24:13.620
Let's go.

24:32.830 --> 24:33.960
Don't block the way.

24:35.540 --> 24:36.550
I'm sorry.

24:37.000 --> 24:38.370
You look unfamiliar.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.640
What's your name?

24:40.440 --> 24:41.750
My name is Huang Ying.

24:42.550 --> 24:44.350
Such a vulgar name.

24:44.480 --> 24:46.400
You must be from a humble family.

24:46.480 --> 24:47.640
As a woman,

24:47.880 --> 24:49.830
how did you let yourself get so fat?

24:50.400 --> 24:52.350
You have no regard for your appearance.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.790
What rank is your father?

24:53.960 --> 24:55.090
Where does he serve?

24:56.030 --> 24:58.480
My father is highly
favored by His Majesty,

24:58.750 --> 24:59.800
but

25:00.160 --> 25:01.550
I'm born of a concubine.

25:02.270 --> 25:03.430
It was my mother...

25:04.270 --> 25:07.110
My mother raised me all by herself.

25:09.380 --> 25:11.770
No wonder you look so unsophisticated.

25:12.510 --> 25:14.680
My father holds a second-rank position.

25:14.680 --> 25:16.000
I've seen plenty of children like you—

25:16.000 --> 25:17.310
born to lowborn women.

25:18.240 --> 25:20.500
Your mother must be just a lowly servant.

25:20.640 --> 25:21.400
Your mouth

25:21.400 --> 25:23.110
is filthier than a latrine.

25:26.830 --> 25:27.960
Say that again.

25:27.960 --> 25:29.690
I'll say it again just the same.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.960
You pride yourself on your noble birth,

25:30.960 --> 25:32.880
yet your view
of the world is painfully narrow.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.480
Every day you just flaunt
your family status

25:34.480 --> 25:35.400
and throw your weight around.

25:35.400 --> 25:37.590
In reality, you're just a parasite,
living off others.

25:37.590 --> 25:38.480
You lowborn trash,

25:38.480 --> 25:39.830
how dare you speak to me disrespectfully!

25:39.830 --> 25:41.030
Just try to touch me.

25:41.790 --> 25:43.110
I know demonic arts.

25:44.720 --> 25:45.850
It's all your fault!

25:46.830 --> 25:49.160
Your stupidity is holding everyone back.

25:50.110 --> 25:50.840
Are you okay?

25:51.550 --> 25:52.750
Why didn't you dodge?

25:53.480 --> 25:54.660
I'm fine.

25:55.000 --> 25:56.200
I'm used to it.

25:59.580 --> 26:00.480
Hit back.

26:03.400 --> 26:04.670
If Huang Ying hits back,

26:04.670 --> 26:05.800
it would be one slap.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.000
If I do it for her,

26:07.050 --> 26:08.590
who knows how many hits it would be?

26:08.590 --> 26:09.720
Which do you choose?

26:14.360 --> 26:15.200
Do you want to hit back yourself

26:15.200 --> 26:16.530
or should I do it for you?

26:16.640 --> 26:17.630
I'm fine.

26:17.830 --> 26:18.920
Really, I'm fine.

26:19.550 --> 26:21.350
You don't need to stand up for me.

26:22.880 --> 26:23.770
Apologize now.

26:28.720 --> 26:29.580
I'm sorry.

26:37.440 --> 26:38.500
What's that sound?

26:44.070 --> 26:44.790
The cry

26:45.440 --> 26:46.970
comes from this zither.

26:59.590 --> 27:00.430
[Wu]

27:02.290 --> 27:03.290
[Gong]

27:26.330 --> 27:29.330
Everyone be careful!
Don't get hit by the light beams!

27:41.880 --> 27:43.270
[Wu]

27:54.070 --> 27:55.310
The Realm of Mist and Void

27:55.310 --> 27:57.270
hasn't been this lively for a long time.

27:57.270 --> 27:59.000
The way to solve this mechanism

27:59.440 --> 28:01.160
is within this deadly formation.

28:01.160 --> 28:02.810
If they remain agitated,

28:02.850 --> 28:04.380
it will be hard to discover.

28:04.380 --> 28:05.280
[Jue]

28:05.410 --> 28:06.490
[Zhi]

28:07.400 --> 28:08.000
Watch out!

28:19.240 --> 28:19.770
Xiao Yao!

28:20.160 --> 28:21.290
Help me, please!

28:27.250 --> 28:28.710
Come on. Listen to me now.

28:28.730 --> 28:29.790
Put your foot here.

28:31.460 --> 28:33.060
You can place your hand here.

28:33.350 --> 28:34.130
Give me that hand.

28:34.130 --> 28:34.930
Duck your head.

28:34.930 --> 28:35.790
Lean sideways.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.740
One, two, three.

28:40.950 --> 28:41.810
Good. Let's go.

28:53.640 --> 28:55.500
This zither needs to drink blood.

28:57.790 --> 28:58.970
How do you know that?

29:00.000 --> 29:02.000
When the light beam
was absorbing blood just now,

29:02.000 --> 29:03.800
strings appeared on the zither.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.820
So this zither must be the key.

29:05.830 --> 29:07.960
It needs to drink blood to be complete.

29:08.030 --> 29:08.590
However,

29:09.200 --> 29:11.660
the blood it absorbed earlier
was too little

29:12.110 --> 29:13.440
to produce new strings.

29:15.920 --> 29:16.450
Xiao Yao,

29:17.110 --> 29:19.170
the two missing strings on the zither

29:19.350 --> 29:21.480
must be found among these light beams.

29:29.350 --> 29:31.030
I've been sickly since childhood

29:31.030 --> 29:32.350
with a lack of energy and blood.

29:32.350 --> 29:34.030
She who donates some

29:34.110 --> 29:36.200
can have all my silver and gold.

29:36.590 --> 29:38.850
What's the use of wealth when one's dead?

29:40.000 --> 29:42.030
We must break this deadlock.

29:42.750 --> 29:44.860
Since we all came here together,

29:45.030 --> 29:47.290
why don't we each contribute some blood?

29:47.510 --> 29:48.640
Sounds about right.

29:48.960 --> 29:49.820
Who goes first?

29:54.800 --> 29:57.800
Let's go by
our fathers' or brothers' official ranks,

29:58.270 --> 29:59.600
from lowest to highest,

30:00.360 --> 30:01.640
starting with those
related to low-level officials.

30:01.640 --> 30:04.540
What if the blood from the first few
is enough?

30:04.680 --> 30:06.200
Then those who haven't donated

30:06.200 --> 30:08.200
will profit without making an effort,
right?

30:08.200 --> 30:10.890
The Immortal Lord will assess us
based on our merits.

30:10.890 --> 30:12.550
Have you forgotten that rule?

30:14.550 --> 30:15.250
But...

30:16.200 --> 30:16.930
You go first!

30:18.880 --> 30:19.670
My face!

30:19.920 --> 30:21.470
I must've been disfigured!

30:21.510 --> 30:22.510
No, it's not true.

30:22.820 --> 30:23.940
Your face is fine.

30:25.600 --> 30:26.710
Are you even human?

30:26.750 --> 30:28.920
Her brother rose to power

30:28.920 --> 30:30.380
with my father's support.

30:30.790 --> 30:31.930
Let's say her blood

30:32.110 --> 30:33.440
is a token of gratitude.

30:38.680 --> 30:39.880
More blood is needed.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.410
You're next!

30:42.590 --> 30:43.270
I'm not going!

30:43.270 --> 30:44.000
But you must!

30:44.370 --> 30:44.830
No!

30:44.830 --> 30:45.410
Just go!

30:45.790 --> 30:46.310
Enough!

30:46.310 --> 30:46.910
Off you go!

30:48.070 --> 30:49.920
This place is already haunted
by a vengeful spirit.

30:49.920 --> 30:51.620
Don't you want a few more around?

30:51.620 --> 30:53.680
We must figure out
how these mechanisms work,

30:53.680 --> 30:54.920
or we'll all end up dead here.

30:54.920 --> 30:57.450
That doesn't justify
taking a person's life!

31:01.680 --> 31:03.410
Let's think of something else.

31:06.070 --> 31:07.130
I don't want to die.

31:08.350 --> 31:09.590
Dali, what should we do?

31:09.590 --> 31:12.030
These light beams are coming the mirrors.

31:13.030 --> 31:14.510
There must be something special
about these mirrors.

31:13.300 --> 31:15.180
[Zhi]

31:15.180 --> 31:16.530
[Jue]

31:18.480 --> 31:20.340
Dali, please think of something!

31:22.200 --> 31:23.200
What should we do?

31:23.350 --> 31:24.500
I want to go home.

31:29.830 --> 31:30.350
Gong.

31:31.400 --> 31:32.070
Shang.

31:34.160 --> 31:34.830
Jue.

31:35.030 --> 31:35.590
Zhi.

31:37.550 --> 31:38.110
Wu.

31:39.310 --> 31:39.920
Wen.

31:41.640 --> 31:42.200
Yu.

31:43.960 --> 31:46.420
These 7 characters
are related to the guqin.

31:47.510 --> 31:49.170
You're quite knowledgeable.

31:49.350 --> 31:50.310
You bet I am.

31:51.030 --> 31:52.090
Let me check it out.

31:52.590 --> 31:53.720
Be careful, Xiao Yao.

31:53.720 --> 31:54.550
Think of something!

31:54.550 --> 31:55.160
What should we do?

31:55.160 --> 31:56.750
Yeah, Dali.

31:59.680 --> 32:00.960
It's so scary here.

32:02.380 --> 32:03.060
[Gong]

32:04.510 --> 32:05.170
Can someone

32:05.270 --> 32:07.550
look at the characters on those mirrors?

32:07.720 --> 32:08.580
Those mirrors?

32:08.720 --> 32:09.240
I'll go!

32:09.830 --> 32:10.440
Let's go.

32:10.920 --> 32:11.650
Come help me.

32:13.720 --> 32:14.310
Look.

32:20.590 --> 32:22.160
It looks like the character "Shang,"
the second note of the Pentatonic scale.

32:22.160 --> 32:23.550
The second one appears to be Jue,
the third note.

32:23.550 --> 32:26.280
The one after that seems like Zhi,
the fifth note.

32:26.510 --> 32:27.110
Indeed,

32:27.590 --> 32:30.400
the mirror corresponds
to the seven zither strings:

32:30.400 --> 32:33.000
Gong, Shang, Jue, Zhi, Yu, Wen, Wu...

32:34.840 --> 32:35.750
[Gong]

32:49.790 --> 32:50.350
Watch out!

32:50.350 --> 32:51.480
What are you trying to do?

32:51.480 --> 32:52.790
You'll get us all killed!

32:52.790 --> 32:53.930
This mechanism is treacherous—

32:53.930 --> 32:54.940
if you match mirrors
with the same character,

32:54.940 --> 32:56.030
but with one of them flipped
to its other side,

32:56.030 --> 32:57.350
it will shift

32:57.350 --> 32:58.330
all the mirrors

32:58.400 --> 32:59.930
and change the light beams.

33:00.070 --> 33:02.480
Moving the mirrors requires two people
working together.

33:02.480 --> 33:03.790
Now, who among you
is willing to step up,

33:03.790 --> 33:05.510
turn that "Gong" mirror

33:05.510 --> 33:06.610
to face my side,

33:06.880 --> 33:08.340
and gamble with me on this?

33:14.860 --> 33:15.720
This mechanism

33:15.880 --> 33:18.740
can only be solved
only if everyone works together.

33:19.030 --> 33:21.490
No matter how clever
and capable Xiao Yao is,

33:22.090 --> 33:23.440
it's useless

33:24.240 --> 33:25.700
if she's held back by them.

33:26.000 --> 33:28.510
They've always been
suspicious and exclusive,

33:28.510 --> 33:30.780
each lost in their own calculations—

33:30.900 --> 33:32.230
scattered and divided.

33:32.830 --> 33:35.090
No wonder they're trapped in this array.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.000
I'll do it!

33:38.880 --> 33:39.530
Xiao Yao,

33:39.920 --> 33:40.880
if it hadn't been for you earlier,

33:40.880 --> 33:42.280
I'd be dead already.

33:42.790 --> 33:44.520
I'll take this gamble with you.

34:08.110 --> 34:08.920
Be careful.

34:18.670 --> 34:19.409
Xiao Yao.

34:24.449 --> 34:26.590
[Gong]

34:31.460 --> 34:35.110
[Gong]

34:36.989 --> 34:38.520
[Gong]

34:40.030 --> 34:40.900
It worked!

34:44.670 --> 34:45.929
The light beams are gone.

34:45.929 --> 34:46.880
Next one.

34:56.000 --> 34:57.330
[Shang]

34:59.070 --> 35:00.530
I can't reach it, Xiao Yao.

35:02.000 --> 35:02.510
This…

35:08.440 --> 35:09.510
Dali,

35:10.030 --> 35:11.120
what should we do?

35:20.080 --> 35:28.080
[Shang]

35:29.380 --> 35:33.040
[Shang]

35:46.190 --> 35:46.940
Great!

35:52.180 --> 35:54.080
[Jue]

35:55.930 --> 35:58.590
[Jue]

36:07.000 --> 36:08.180
[Yu]

36:08.250 --> 36:09.950
[Wen]

36:10.000 --> 36:11.340
[Wu]

36:20.880 --> 36:22.340
They cleared it this fast?

36:22.960 --> 36:24.690
In previous trials,

36:24.860 --> 36:26.710
71% couldn't get past this point.

36:26.710 --> 36:28.110
Who said they cleared it?

36:28.630 --> 36:30.630
If it were just the same old routine,

36:30.840 --> 36:32.240
wouldn't that be boring?

36:32.890 --> 36:35.220
We added some new twists—

36:36.590 --> 36:38.320
just wait for what comes next.

36:56.800 --> 36:58.440
All human hearts are scheming,

36:58.440 --> 37:00.110
rife with deceit

37:00.360 --> 37:02.000
and selfish gain—

37:02.000 --> 37:03.960
who pities the souls
that died wronged?

37:03.960 --> 37:05.820
They yearn to break their chains,

37:05.880 --> 37:08.680
to find in a song's final note
their lasting peace.

37:10.480 --> 37:13.680
She wants to hear a melody
that can soothe her resentment.

37:13.880 --> 37:15.230
What's so hard about that?

37:15.230 --> 37:17.230
I used to listen
to the birds sing every day—

37:17.230 --> 37:19.090
I know plenty of lovely melodies.

37:20.280 --> 37:22.880
But the zither strings
aren't all gathered yet—

37:22.880 --> 37:25.070
how can we play anything good?

37:27.480 --> 37:28.070
Wait!

37:36.840 --> 37:37.920
Stop, Dali!

37:41.230 --> 37:42.220
I can't stop!

37:48.880 --> 37:49.500
Oh no,

37:49.630 --> 37:51.360
the candles are about to go out!

37:52.800 --> 37:53.800
Mind the candles!

37:53.960 --> 37:54.770
Be careful!

37:58.960 --> 37:59.360
Xiao Yao!

37:59.360 --> 37:59.840
Watch out!

37:59.840 --> 38:00.550
Look out!

38:01.920 --> 38:03.110
Make Dali stop now!

38:04.670 --> 38:05.710
It hurts!

38:07.390 --> 38:08.440
Help her!

38:13.710 --> 38:14.330
Slow down!

38:14.670 --> 38:15.400
Are you okay?

38:16.320 --> 38:16.990
Dali!

38:22.600 --> 38:23.600
Time to serve

38:24.550 --> 38:25.590
the extra course.

38:55.070 --> 38:55.840
Xiao Yao!

38:55.920 --> 38:57.250
Xiao Yao!

39:03.630 --> 39:04.650
Xiao Yao!

39:06.360 --> 39:07.660
What do we do, Xiao Yao?

39:08.630 --> 39:09.280
Dali!
